msgid "Certificate fingerprints confirmed on previous connections (TOFU verification). Removing an entry requires confirmation again the next time you connect to that server."
msgstr "先前连接中已确认的证书指纹（TOFU 验证）。删除条目后，下次连接到该服务器时需要重新确认。"

