msgstr "验证服务器身份"

msgid ""
"This is the first connection to <b>{address}</b>.\n"
"\n"
"Certificate fingerprint (SHA-256):\n"
"<tt>{fingerprint}</tt>\n"
"\n"
"Confirm with the server administrator that this fingerprint is correct before continuing."
msgstr "这是首次连接到 <b>{address}</b>。\\n\\n证书指纹 (SHA-256)：\\n<tt>{fingerprint}</tt>\\n\\n继续前，请向服务器管理员确认此指纹正确。"

msgid "Trust and connect"
msgstr "信任并连接"

msgid "⚠ Possible attack detected"
msgstr "⚠ 检测到可能的攻击"

msgid ""
"The certificate presented by <b>{address}</b> has changed since the last connection.\n"
"\n"
"Previous fingerprint:\n"
"<tt>{previous}</tt>\n"
"\n"
"Current fingerprint:\n"
"<tt>{fingerprint}</tt>\n"
"\n"
"This may indicate an attempt to intercept the connection (man-in-the-middle), or simply that the server certificate was renewed. Continue only if you are certain of the reason."
msgstr "<b>{address}</b> 提供的证书自上次连接后已更改。\\n\\n之前的指纹：\\n<tt>{previous}</tt>\\n\\n当前指纹：\\n<tt>{fingerprint}</tt>\\n\\n这可能表示有人试图拦截连接（中间人攻击），也可能只是服务器证书已更新。只有在确定原因时才继续。"

msgid "Trust anyway"
msgstr "仍然信任"

